OL,3,AMan charged over Belfast knife attack
OL,4,Apleads not guilty
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man charged in connection with a
OL,7,Fknife attack in north Belfast that
OL,8,Fsparked serious disorder in the city
OL,9,Fhas pleaded not guilty to attempted
OL,10,Fmurder.
OL,12,FHadi Alodid, 31, of Duncairn Avenue in
OL,13,FBelfast, has also denied possessing a
OL,14,Fbladed weapon and a charge of
OL,15,Fthreatening or abusive behaviour.
OL,17,FAlodid is accused of carrying out the
OL,18,Fattack on Stephen Ogilvie in June.
OL,20,FStephen Ogilvie, who is in his 40s,
OL,21,Flost his left eye in the incident and
OL,22,Fsustained damage to his right.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
